- Added multiple model support
- Changed `POST` payload for `/similarity` endpoint to
``` json
{
    "base_model_idx": 1,
    "inputs": [
        {
            "model_name": "name of model",
            "content": "this is base sentence"
        },
        {
            "model_name": "name of another model",
            "content": "this is another sentence"
        },
        {
            "model_name": "name of different model",
            "content": "this is a different sentence"
        },
        .
        .
        .
    ]
}
```

- Added type-safe classes for checking payloads and responses

Multiple initial implementation improvements:
- build process optimization (caching, build time and size);
- batch commands improvements (+Linux commands);
- code cleanup, refactoring, etc.

